    evaluate require with passed being ((try-fill-range of T with items being data, offset being minimum, count being 1, item-value being third) equals false), label being "fill rejects window"
    evaluate same-items of T with actual being alias, expected being original, label being "rejected fill preserves alias"
    evaluate require with passed being ((try-fill-range of T with items being data, offset being 0, count being minimum, item-value being third) equals false), label being "fill rejects window"
    evaluate same-items of T with actual being alias, expected being original, label being "rejected fill preserves alias"
    evaluate require with passed being (try-fill-range of T with items being data, offset being 4, count being 0, item-value being third), label being "fill endpoint"
    evaluate require with passed being (try-fill-range of T with items being data, offset being 0, count being 0, item-value being third), label being "fill empty window"
    evaluate same-items of T with actual being alias, expected being original, label being "zero fill preserves array"
    evaluate require with passed being ((try-copy-range of T with source being original, source-offset being minus 1, destination being data, destination-offset being 0, count being 1) equals false), label being "copy rejects window"
    evaluate same-items of T with actual being alias, expected being [first, second, third, first], label being "rejected copy preserves destination"
    evaluate same-items of T with actual being original, expected being [first, second, third, first], label being "rejected copy preserves source"
