    evaluate same-items of T with actual being alias, expected being [first, second, third, first], label being "rejected copy preserves destination"
    evaluate same-items of T with actual being original, expected being [first, second, third, first], label being "rejected copy preserves source"
    evaluate require with passed being ((try-copy-range of T with source being original, source-offset being 0, destination being data, destination-offset being 5, count being 0) equals false), label being "copy rejects window"
    evaluate same-items of T with actual being alias, expected being [first, second, third, first], label being "rejected copy preserves destination"
    evaluate same-items of T with actual being original, expected being [first, second, third, first], label being "rejected copy preserves source"
    evaluate require with passed being ((try-copy-range of T with source being original, source-offset being 3, destination being data, destination-offset being 0, count being 2) equals false), label being "copy rejects window"
    evaluate same-items of T with actual being alias, expected being [first, second, third, first], label being "rejected copy preserves destination"
    evaluate same-items of T with actual being original, expected being [first, second, third, first], label being "rejected copy preserves source"
